{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/CRYP-steam-description_header-about-EN.png?t=1736354737\" />Crypterion is a new approach to visual novels, mixing open-world adventuring with a complex plot where every choice matters and no two playthroughs will ever be the same.\u00a0 Start by defining your character, navigate down a myriad of branching paths, and become the most powerful person in Rimshot. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/CRYP-steam-description_header-features-EN.png?t=1736354737\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/CRYP-GIF_numeri-2024_10_09.gif?t=1736354737\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique blend of visual novels, point-and-click adventures, and open-world exploration, with open-ended gameplay allowing you to decide which way to rise to the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over two hundred choices branching the plot into multiple non-overlapping story arcs, fleshed out by a script totaling over 200,000 words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable main character with selectable preferences, dislikes, and more, which the game will react to - and more changes occur as you progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 6 unique planets of the Rimshot system, seeking a path to riches and power. Build a business, look for spoils, become a TV celebrity - and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Failure is not an option: When your character stumbles, some paths close, others open - even if these lead to places where you have to work off your debt... Or launch a daring escape.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/CRYP-steam-description_header-meetcrew-EN.png?t=1736354737\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/_CRYP__crew_complete.png?t=1736354737\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with nearly 40 distinct characters, including eleven unique crewmates. A Saboteur, Genius, Stowaway, Mechanic, Security Officer, Informant, Cook, Doctor, Pilot, Guardian, and Secret Agent.\u00a0Build relations, forge lasting friendships, and even entertain marriage proposals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/CRYP-steam-description_header-community-EN.png?t=1736354737\" />Players can submit questions on our Discord for a chance to be featured on the in-game TV show, <i>Face To Face\u00ae</i>! Join Sunny Dae, everyone\u2019s favorite TV host, as he asks hard-hitting questions to his guests. Plus, share your fan art with the community\u2014your work might be displayed in-game at locations like the gallery, auction house, treasury, and other points of interest!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/CRYP-GIF_gallery-2024_10_09.gif?t=1736354737\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A rank celebrity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/a7107d097dc9b825328d653bfa6abb9bc1205d90.jpg"},{"name":"Capture a bounty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/c5a687b7ee10bdf26fbaabd19f7ddbf5dcf91a99.jpg"},{"name":"Choose your love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/ca19a15c80a6c6274bb07682db8947f88ed9e142.jpg"},{"name":"Love your choice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/105e76717c689331b2f3d267820c8ae138305489.jpg"},{"name":"Collect 3 Artifacts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/1df80a938c0eac7fedb159ec24630e6bd8d6f70c.jpg"},{"name":"Collect 6 Artifacts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/b866beda24e3772da9d2a992c991c7eecd26ad62.jpg"},{"name":"Fill the gallery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/b1c84a862be28cfcb9d2c3d54fd994e27fab09d7.jpg"},{"name":"Fill the treasury","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/7783b81abc7f4d68335d1cd662b0ed4cb88c1672.jpg"},{"name":"Find the hidden ring","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/2f1ca172f27f3663bcb65caebc3c7c3ba7d5f9c3.jpg"},{"name":"Go on a date","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/865863c2296f17e1a27779cd66e2872a73eea68f.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1048860?t=1736354737","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1736354737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/bea58cb80186504bbcaffdf08068b75d9a6812a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1736354737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/bea58cb80186504bbcaffdf08068b75d9a6812a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1736354737","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1323010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/CRYP-steam-description_header-about-EN.png?t=1736354737\" />Crypterion is a new approach to visual novels, 